--- !u!114 &2025123670
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2025123668}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c68ee4d7dceb346ba4f60d3f40e2cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcID: Sarah_Act2_1
  npcName: Sarah
  dialogueLines:
  - So what's wrong?
  - "I was wondering if you know what happened at the party? It seemed like I passed
    out\u2026\u2026 "
  - 'I wish. There was a power outage,and I was literally so scared that my son would
    get lost, so we left early. '
  - '(guilt) I didn''t mean to just leave out of nowhere... '
  - '(Hmmm, it seems like she doesn''t know much, but there was an outage.) '
  - '(confused)Why? Is everything okay? '
  - "(weird) Well\u2026 Uh\u2026 how do I say this\u2026 When I woke up, I found
    what was left of Kosmo and Trevor\u2026\u2026 "
  - 'What??? We NEED to call the Police! '
  - "That's what I wanted to, but the lines are cut, and it seems  like the elevator
    is the only way out, but it\u2019s locked. "
  - 'MOM is something wrong? '
  - 'No, sweetie, continue working out your brachialis muscles! '
  - 'Alright im going to see if there''s any way to escape. For now, try to stay
    here and keep the doors locked. '
  - 'Okay, stay safe! '
